Z||000000||Chris McDonald||09-30-2001||12:38 AM||||I finally organized my photopoint account.  You can follow my old V8 Fiero project now from start to finish.  Click on the link and go into the V8 Fiero Album.<P>Enjoy.<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1428880" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1428880</A> ||||reg||1
